0..49 Comment "//! `passed` returns a thunk at its input region."
50..53 Comment "//!"
54..135 Comment "//! The caller reads the returned thunk before that region ends. The pathological"
136..198 Comment "//! twin refuses a result held in no region as `TypeMismatch`."
199..202 Comment "//!"
203..280 Comment "//! `pass` returns its argument unchanged. The `passed` run returns `4`. Rust"
281..346 Comment "//! writes the same lifetime in `fn pass<\'a>(k: &\'a T) -> &\'a T`."
347..350 Comment "//!"
351..433 Comment "//! - see: corpus/pathological/regions/outlived.gandr — a result past its region"
